- Midnight Reaper (4/3) - Dies in mutual combat with the 4/4\n\
\n\
Wait, Midnight Reaper shows as 4/3 but it should be 3/2. Let me check if Lord of the Accursed is pumping it... Yes! Lord gives +1/+1 to all Zombies. So:\n\
