- Midnight Reaper (4/3) deals 4 damage to Galea (4/4) - **Galea dies**\n\
- Galea deals 4 damage to Midnight Reaper (3 toughness) - **Midnight Reaper dies**\n\
- Midnight Reaper triggers, I draw a card and take 1 damage\n\
\n\
