So:\n\
Option A: Cast Kaalia (10). chump blocker.\n\
Option B: Hold Congregate (4). Gain 24 life.\n\
Kaalia dies to removal or attacks.\n\
Congregate is guaranteed survival.\n\
And life gain might matter if I draw something like `Phyrexian Arena` (no, I need cards).\n\
\n\
I play land.\n\
Pass turn?\n\
No, play Congregate on opponent's turn?\n\
Actually, `Congregate` is Instant. I can wait until end of their turn or during combat.\n\
Better to wait.\n\
For now, play land.\n\
\n\
